# Direct runtime dependencies of the container image. requirements.txt is
# compiled from this file with exact versions and hashes for every package,
# transitive ones included, so an image build is reproducible and verified:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras requirements.in
# (run under the image's Python, 3.13). Dependabot keeps both files in step.
